      "id": "call_of_cthulhu_7e.bout_of_madness",
      "name": "Bout of madness",
      "kind": "subsystem_procedure",
      "description": "The first phase of insanity is a brief loss of self-control in which the Keeper takes over or directs the investigator’s behavior.",
