      "name": "Combat round sequence",
      "kind": "subsystem_procedure",
      "description": "Combat is resolved in rounds so every participant gets a chance to act, with actions described in the fiction and then resolved.",
      "when_to_use": "Use whenever the situation becomes violent and order of action matters.",
