      "name": "Sanity roll and Sanity loss",
      "kind": "subsystem_procedure",
      "description": "Exposure to horrific truths, monsters, or Mythos events can call for a Sanity roll, with success or failure determining how much Sanity is lost.",
      "when_to_use": "Use when an investigator encounters something the rules or scenario deem sanity-blasting, such as a monster, revelation, or supernatural event.",
